          "contract_id": "model-name-tree",
          "asset_type": "model name tree",
          "consumer": "FUN_00123908 relocates the root and group name tree against the file base; FUN_0011ed90 invokes it while parsing a model.",
          "bounds": "The first word gives the next-section offset; the parser rounds base+offset up to 16 bytes. NUL-terminated names are bounded by the name-pool region ending at word0.",
          "field_effects": "Name offsets become pointers into the model name pool; the root/group arrays are count-prefixed. No meaning is assigned to names beyond their use as lookup keys.",
          "transformations": "Archive zlib payload is expanded before model parsing; the loader relocates serialized offsets in its in-memory copy.",
          "allocation_lifetime": "The parser allocates and returns an expanded object; complete ownership/freeing lifetime is unresolved.",
          "handoffs": "FUN_0012d4b8 uses parsed names to look up SKYDOME and MINI_SKYDOME. This is a static lookup path, not proof that a named file is loaded at runtime.",
          "unknowns": [
            "Complete set of name-tree variants",
